<title>USA: Binghamton, N.Y., won by First Albany. [CORRECTED 20:52 GMT]</title>
<headline>Binghamton, N.Y., won by First Albany. [CORRECTED 20:52 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects that First Albany Corp. won the deal rather than Prudential Securities. Also supplies First Albany's net interest cost and scale.)</p>
<p>First Albany Corp. said Thursday it won $10.423 million Binghamton, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.2965 percent.</p>
